 narrates handing a request to a colleague: ''mention'' (name the handoff aloud), ''silent'' (absorb and speak the result as its own), ''hand-voice'' (reserved). Absent => ''mention''. Overridable by app AgentSettings and per-target."},"allowedAgents":{"type":"array","description":"Delegation targets the lead co-agent may invoke via invoke-target-agent. UNION-accumulated across cascade layers (type/co-agent/target/app) + dynamic registrations; never array-replaced.","items":{"type":"object","additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"agentId":{"type":"string","description":"The target agent''s MJ: AI Agents ID (loop or flow)."},"label":{"type":"string","description":"Friendly name for the capability manifest / disclosure narration."},"disclosure":{"type":"string","enum":["silent","mention","hand-voice"],"description":"Per-target disclosure override; falls back to the effective default."}},"required":["agentId"]}}}}}}'
